{"id": "accessible-van-trip-reporting", "title": "Why do all four parts of the day fall below the annual on-time rate?", "seconds": 62.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:iPYqcpY8j8Ap4jUf28I3", "narrator": "Michael", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "23d15c207958a2e8", "words": 154, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "The annual on-time rate was 79 percent. This is an investigative lead.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.16, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["79", "percent"], "sub": "Four time-of-day rates cannot yield the published yearly figure on the same basis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.6, 1.12, 1.43, 1.63, 2.23, 3.39, 3.64, 3.76, 3.87, 4.61]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "But all four times of day scored lower. The highest was 73.26 percent.", "t0": 5.28, "t1": 12.13, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "annual", "layout": "table", "heading": "On-time pickups", "context": "FY2018–19 summary", "rows": [{"label": "Annual rate", "value": "79%"}, {"label": "Highest time band", "value": "73.26%"}, {"label": "Evening", "value": "60.18%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.39, 0.73, 1.07, 1.2, 1.49, 1.98, 2.93, 3.15, 4.08, 4.3, 5.24, 5.62, 6.01, 6.33]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "If all four groups use the same trips, no weighted average can reach the annual figure.", "t0": 12.25, "t1": 17.34, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual", "kicker": "Four time-of-day rates cannot yield the published yearly figure on the same basis", "text": "Four time periods", "mark": "Four"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.46, 0.71, 1.06, 1.27, 1.39, 1.69, 2.66, 2.98, 3.35, 3.7, 3.87, 4.13, 4.27, 4.67]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "An earlier report supports the annual number. So do the monthly data.", "t0": 17.56, "t1": 22.83, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "questions", "kicker": "Earlier answers and the monthly data support the annual improvement", "text": "Separate records agree", "mark": "Separate"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.64, 1.23, 1.75, 1.89, 2.25, 3.2, 4.2, 4.39, 4.5, 4.89]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "By fiscal 2023 the monthly rates averaged 97.43 percent.", "t0": 22.95, "t1": 28.55, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "monthly", "layout": "table", "heading": "Equal weight per month", "context": "Monthly on-time rates", "rows": [{"label": "FY2018–19", "value": "79.17%"}, {"label": "FY2022–23", "value": "97.43%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.61, 0.92, 1.63, 1.76, 2.17, 2.54, 3.0, 3.94, 4.27, 4.56, 4.84]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "A second table says scheduled trips declined by 37 percent.", "t0": 28.67, "t1": 32.86, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual", "kicker": "The scheduled-trip change is printed as 37%", "text": "Scheduled trips", "mark": "Scheduled"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.56, 0.99, 1.33, 1.91, 2.36, 2.91, 3.07, 3.66]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "The two counts shown give a decline of 21.62 percent.", "t0": 32.98, "t1": 37.77, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "annual", "layout": "table", "heading": "Scheduled trips", "context": "Figure 16", "rows": [{"label": "FY2018–19", "value": "206,659"}, {"label": "FY2022–23", "value": "161,980"}, {"label": "Decline", "value": "21.62%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.35, 0.72, 1.3, 1.52, 1.59, 2.18, 2.31, 2.89, 3.25, 3.96, 4.24]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "We checked the separate table for performed trips.", "t0": 37.89, "t1": 40.7, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "annual", "kicker": "The performed-trip detail contains additional discrepancies", "text": "Performed trips", "mark": "Performed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.54, 0.68, 1.06, 1.47, 1.65, 2.23]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "The rows add up. The total fell 20.26 percent, below the printed decline.", "t0": 40.82, "t1": 47.48, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "record", "source": "annual", "layout": "table", "heading": "Performed trips", "context": "Figure 2", "rows": [{"label": "Printed", "value": "22%"}, {"label": "Recalculated", "value": "20.26%"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.76, 1.04, 1.62, 1.83, 2.19, 2.49, 2.95, 3.35, 3.69, 4.09, 5.15, 5.58, 5.69, 6.04]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "By late 2025, the broker was reporting 95 to 96 percent of pickups on time.", "t0": 47.7, "t1": 54.12, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "minutes", "kicker": "Later reporting continued to show higher punctuality", "text": "Later broker report", "mark": "Later"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.48, 0.8, 1.96, 2.1, 2.44, 2.61, 3.15, 4.02, 4.16, 4.82, 5.25, 5.36, 5.79, 5.96]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "The counts by time of day would explain how riders fared at different hours.", "t0": 54.24, "t1": 58.53, "shot": "s10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Which pickups were counted?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.52, 0.74, 1.08, 1.21, 1.53, 1.73, 2.24, 2.46, 2.88, 3.33, 3.45, 3.77]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 58.65, "t1": 61.16, "shot": "end", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.37, 0.48, 0.57, 1.41, 1.63, 1.74]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"p": "Four time-of-day rates cannot yield the published yearly figure on the same basis", "b": "Earlier answers and the monthly data support the annual improvement", "o": "Later reporting continued to show higher punctuality"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}